import ../../helpers/driver.dl
import ../../../ui/source_tools.dl

document example:
    editor "Source" containing "g" using no UI appearance

set instance to an instance of example
set window to the address of instance
set view to a UI view of window sized 900 by 600 using font "regular" with the test UI driver
set workspace to a UI source workspace in window rooted at "file:///workspace"
enable UI source tools for workspace in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 3 key 258 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
update UI source tools in workspace
set pasted to the string form of "first line\nsecond line\n"
set epoch to view's input context's epoch
queue UI input of kind 13 key epoch at (pasted's length as a floating-point number) (pasted's length as a floating-point number) with modifiers 0 containing pasted in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set view's seconds to 1.0
update UI source tools in workspace
require condition (workspace's tools' mode = 0) reporting "Pasting a complete source opened an automatic completion menu."
queue UI input of kind 4 key 0 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "x" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set view's seconds to 1.2
update UI source tools in workspace
require condition (workspace's tools' mode = 1) reporting "Typing one character did not request automatic completion."
queue UI input of kind 3 key 256 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 4 key 0 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "\n" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set view's seconds to 2.0
update UI source tools in workspace
require condition (workspace's tools' mode = 0) reporting "Entering a new line opened suggestions without a word."
set value to the UI value for (the control labeled "Source" in window) in window
set prior to value's text
queue UI input of kind 4 key 1 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "p" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set view's seconds to 3.0
update UI source tools in workspace
require condition (value's text = (prior + "p")) reporting "The clipboard character was not inserted."
require condition (workspace's tools' mode = 0) reporting "Pasting one character opened automatic suggestions."
queue UI input of kind 3 key 32 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 2 containing "" in (the address of view)
process UI input in (the address of view)
require condition (workspace's tools' mode = 1) reporting "Explicit completion stopped working after a paste."
queue UI input of kind 3 key 256 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set epoch to view's input context's epoch
queue UI input of kind 10 key epoch at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 1 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 10 key epoch at 2.0 2.0 with modifiers 2 containing "東京" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set view's seconds to 4.0
update UI source tools in workspace
require condition (workspace's tools' mode = 0) reporting "Tentative composition opened a suggestion list."
queue UI input of kind 10 key epoch at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set committed to value's text + "東京"
set offset to the UTF-16 position of UTF-8 byte offset (committed's length) in committed
queue UI input of kind 13 key (view's input context's epoch) at (offset's position as a floating-point number) (offset's position as a floating-point number) with modifiers 0 containing committed in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set view's seconds to 4.2
update UI source tools in workspace
require condition (workspace's tools' mode = 1) reporting "Committing an IME word did not request suggestions."
queue UI input of kind 3 key 256 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 4 key 0 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "x" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 7 key 0 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set view's seconds to 5.0
update UI source tools in workspace
require condition (workspace's tools' mode = 0) reporting "A pending suggestion opened after surface focus was lost."
free UI source workspace workspace
close the address of view
close window
print line "Automatic completion follows typed characters; paste and newlines require explicit suggestions."
